    "protocol": {
      "scope": "Current source algorithm; historical counts are recorded below. Freeze task membership before applying it.",
      "cohort_partition": "For each original training cohort sort task IDs by SHA256(\"{domain}|v{cohort}|{task_id}\"). Validation is the first n_val rows, where n_val=min(n-1,max(1,round(n/3))); learn is the remainder. A cohort smaller than two tasks cannot be searched.",
      "search": "Default pooled validation includes cohorts 1..k. Learning uses the newest cohort when a non-seed winner is inherited, otherwise cumulative learn rows. --stage-local is a different experiment.",
      "held_out": "R[k,j] evaluates held-out cohort j with stage-k adaptation. Lower triangle uses C_k; forward cells use C_max(k,j). Held-out results do not enter selection.",
      "repeats": "Search trials_per_task and held-out --num-runs are separate. Archived held-out results use runs 1,2,3 for each cell.",
      "aggregation": "Within each run pool task score/success across the selected cells, then equally average the three run means. Standard deviation is population SD across runs. Preserve each denominator and absent records; do not fill missing data with zeros.",
